       "children": [
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": "Ankara'ya"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": ", which sits just before the verb. The speaker already knows you are going somewhere and asks only about the destination. Compare "
      },
      {
