      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": " otobüs geç mi?"
      }
     ],
     "en": "I wonder if the bus is late.",
     "note": [
      {
       "kind": "em",
       "children": [
        {
         "kind": "text",
         "text": "Acaba"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "kind": "text",
       "text": " at the start of a yes/no question. The question still needs mI after "
